cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mpCGC, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "mpCGC: marine polysaccharide CAZyme gene clusterer"
abstract: >-
  A Nextflow pipeline that identifies, mines and summarises carbohydrate-active
  enzyme gene clusters (CGCs) in marine microbial genomes and metagenome-assembled
  genomes. mpCGC is the pipeline used to build mpCGCdb (https://mpcgcdb.com).
authors:
  - family-names: Oliver
    given-names: Aaron A.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AaronAOliver/mpCGC"
url: "https://mpcgcdb.com"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - CAZyme
  - polysaccharide utilisation locus
  - marine microbiome
  - metagenome-assembled genome
  - Nextflow
